        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-538 (ensure controlled execution — HR Shared Services &amp; Employee/Manager Self-Service Operations (PA-103.1).) | - operational: enablement and mobile-friendly design; operational: workflow approvals (links to VS-29)
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
