    <bpmn:process id="W_W3331" name="W3331. HR Case Management, Knowledge Base &amp; Tiered Escalation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Case lifecycle; knowledge gap identified
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Case taxonomy + ~hundreds of knowledge articles
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager
Participants: HRSS team, HRBP, Subject experts, Comms (links to VS-103.2)
Source: workflow W3331 — HR Case Management, Knowledge Base &amp; Tiered Escalation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3331_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3331_Lane1" name="HRSS team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3331_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3331_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3331_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3331_Lane2" name="HRSS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3331_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3331_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3331_Start4" name="Case lifecycle; knowledge gap identified">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3331_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3331_Task5" name="HRSS team maintain the case taxonomy (categories, sub-categories, SLA, routing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HRSS team maintain the case taxonomy (categories, sub-categories, SLA, routing rules, templates) and the tier model (Tier-1 self-service/helpdesk, Tier-2 specialist, Tier-3 HRBP/expert) with clear escalation triggers
Responsible (R): HRSS team
Accountable (A): HR Shared Services Mgr
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3331_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3331_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3331_Task6" name="HRSS/SME maintain the HR knowledge base: policy articles, FAQs, how-to guides…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HRSS/SME maintain the HR knowledge base: policy articles, FAQs, how-to guides (leave, benefits, payroll), localized for store/DC/HQ; keep current with policy change (links to VS-102/VS-84) and regulatory change (links to VS-22.3)
Responsible (R): HRSS / SME
Accountable (A): HR Shared Services Mgr
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3331_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3331_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3331_Task7" name="HRSS team review case trends, identify knowledge gaps (recurring questions →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HRSS team review case trends, identify knowledge gaps (recurring questions → new article) and process improvements, and feed analytics to SLA/CSAT monitoring (W3336) and process excellence (W3352)
Responsible (R): HRSS team
Accountable (A): HR Shared Services Mgr
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3331_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3331_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3331_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3331_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3331_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-538 (ensure controlled execution — HR Shared Services &amp; Employee/Manager Self-Service Operations (PA-103.1).) | - operational: review cadence tied to policy change; operational: taxonomy and Tier-1 empowerment
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
