        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HRSS team execute the onboarding service ticket: system access provisioning (links to VS-27/VS-99), equipment (links to VS-99.1), uniform/facilities (links to VS-07.2), payroll/benefits setup (links to VS-19.2/VS-102), and day-1 readiness (links to VS-19.1/W3337)
