      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous monitoring; monthly review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Service-center portfolio
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager
Participants: HRSS team, CHRO, BI (links to VS-28.1), Entity HR
Source: workflow W3336 — HR Service Center SLA, Quality &amp; CSAT Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
