      <bpmn:userTask id="W3336_Task4" name="HR Shared Services Mgr track SLA performance (first-response, resolution time…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR Shared Services Mgr track SLA performance (first-response, resolution time, backlog, aging, reopen rate) by category/entity; capture CSAT after each case and periodic pulse
Responsible (R): HR Shared Services Mgr
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3336_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3336_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3336_Task5" name="HR Shared Services Mgr conduct quality assurance: sample cases for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR Shared Services Mgr conduct quality assurance: sample cases for accuracy/compliance/privacy (links to VS-91), coach agents, and identify training/knowledge gaps (W3331)
Responsible (R): HR Shared Services Mgr
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3336_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3336_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3336_Task6" name="HR Shared Services Mgr report service performance to CHRO and entity HR, drive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR Shared Services Mgr report service performance to CHRO and entity HR, drive continuous improvement (W3352), and benchmark to service-center standards
Responsible (R): HR Shared Services Mgr
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3336_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3336_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3336_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3336_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
