        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-123 (ensure HR service delivery &amp; people-data accuracy.) | - operational: monitoring and staffing; operational: QA sampling and coaching
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
